        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123420/extras/0ae78ef16d61336d80293208918384c5.avif?t=1786537625\" width=378 height=116 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains nearly a hundred carefully selected world-famous paintings, allowing you to effortlessly learn art history while piecing them together. We will also provide long-term free updates, continuously adding more classic artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import local photos to create personalized puzzles (simply rename the image as &quot;Title_Artist_4-digit Year&quot; and place it in a specific folder). Turn precious moments into playable puzzles and create memories that are uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring realistic puzzle mechanics—pieces can be freely dragged and placed, replicating the smooth feel of a physical puzzle. It's not a sliding puzzle, offering more freedom and immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beginner to expert, whether you're new to puzzles or a seasoned pro, you'll find challenges suited to your skill level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why choose &quot;Relaxing Puzzles&quot;?</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recognize famous paintings, learn about master artists, and subtly enhance your artistic knowledge while solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are an effective way to train observation, memory, and logical thinking—quietly boosting your intelligence while having fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple and intuitive rules and easy-to-learn controls, it's suitable for both children and adults, making it an excellent choice for family leisure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game color scheme, and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining education and entertainment, it's perfect for players of all ages. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join now and start your artistic puzzle journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123420/extras/0ae78ef16d61336d80293208918384c5.avif?t=1786537625\" width=378 height=116 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains nearly a hundred carefully selected world-famous paintings, allowing you to effortlessly learn art history while piecing them together. We will also provide long-term free updates, continuously adding more classic artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import local photos to create personalized puzzles (simply rename the image as &quot;Title_Artist_4-digit Year&quot; and place it in a specific folder). Turn precious moments into playable puzzles and create memories that are uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring realistic puzzle mechanics—pieces can be freely dragged and placed, replicating the smooth feel of a physical puzzle. It's not a sliding puzzle, offering more freedom and immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beginner to expert, whether you're new to puzzles or a seasoned pro, you'll find challenges suited to your skill level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why choose &quot;Relaxing Puzzles&quot;?</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recognize famous paintings, learn about master artists, and subtly enhance your artistic knowledge while solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are an effective way to train observation, memory, and logical thinking—quietly boosting your intelligence while having fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple and intuitive rules and easy-to-learn controls, it's suitable for both children and adults, making it an excellent choice for family leisure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game color scheme, and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining education and entertainment, it's perfect for players of all ages. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join now and start your artistic puzzle journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
